WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.239
Step 1. Open the appointment.

1.2
00:00:02.239 --> 00:00:06.149
You can add, change or remove the tags of an appointment.

1.3
00:00:06.149 --> 00:00:11.587
The card at the top of Appointment Details shows the appointment's tags.

2.1
00:00:11.587 --> 00:00:17.970
Step 2. Open the tags. Select the tag button on the card at the top of the page.

2.2
00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:24.296
If the appointment has no tags, it is Add Tags; if it has tags, Manage Tags.

3.1
00:00:24.296 --> 00:00:26.212
Step 3. Choose the tags.

3.2
00:00:26.212 --> 00:00:31.835
Choose the tags that the appointment needs, and remove the ones it does not need.

3.3
00:00:31.835 --> 00:00:36.987
Care saves each change at once and shows Tags updated successfully.
